#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:7
msgid ""
"You can customize many aspects of your Mattermost experience based on "
"your preferences, including notifications for Mattermost activity, how "
"unread channels are organized, the number of direct messages displayed, "
"your Mattermost look and feel, and more!"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 활동 알림, 읽지 않은 채널 정리 방식, 표시되는 개인 메시지 수, "
"OKR.BEST 화면 모양과 느낌 등 OKR.BEST 사용 경험의 많은 부분을 취향에 맞게 "
"사용자 지정할 수 있습니다!"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:11
msgid ""
"Download `this guide to customizing Mattermost for technical teams "
"<https://mattermost.com/customizing-mattermost-for-technical-teams-"
"guide/>`_ to learn how to get more from the platform."
msgstr ""
"`기술 팀을 위한 Mattermost 사용자 지정 가이드 <https://mattermost.com"
"/customizing-mattermost-for-technical-teams-guide/>`_\\ 를 다운로드하여 "
"플랫폼을 더 잘 활용하는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:14
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "더 알아보기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:34
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage your notifications </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"notifications>` - Learn how Mattermost notifications work by default and "
"how to customize notifications based on how you prefer to work."
msgstr ""
":doc:`알림 관리 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications>` - "
"OKR.BEST 알림의 기본 동작과 자신의 업무 방식에 맞게 알림을 사용자 지정하는 "
"방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:35
msgid ""
":doc:`Customize your Mattermost theme </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/customize-your-theme>` - Learn how to change the look and feel of "
"Mattermost based on your preferences."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST 테마 사용자 지정 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-"
"theme>` - 취향에 따라 OKR.BEST의 모양과 느낌을 바꾸는 방법을 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:36
msgid ""
":doc:`Customize your channel sidebar </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/customize-your-channel-sidebar>` - Organize conversations in the sidebar"
" to keep your workspace efficient."
msgstr ""
":doc:`채널 사이드바 사용자 지정 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-your-"
"channel-sidebar>` - 사이드바에서 대화를 정리해 워크스페이스를 효율적으로 "
"유지하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:37
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage your profile </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"profile>` - Configure your Mattermost profile."
msgstr ""
":doc:`프로필 관리 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile>` - "
"OKR.BEST 프로필을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:38
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage your security preferences </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-security-preferences>` - Configure your Mattermost security "
"preferences."
msgstr ""
":doc:`보안 환경설정 관리 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-"
"preferences>` - OKR.BEST 보안 환경설정을 구성하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:39
msgid ""
":doc:`Set your status and availability </end-user-guide/preferences/set-"
"your-status-availability>` - Let your team know whether you’re available."
msgstr ""
":doc:`상태 및 접속 가능 여부 설정 </end-user-guide/preferences/set-your-"
"status-availability>` - 팀에 자신의 접속 가능 여부를 알리세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:40
msgid ""
":doc:`Customize your display options </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-display-options>` - Customize your Mattermost display to suit your "
"preferences."
msgstr ""
":doc:`표시 옵션 사용자 지정 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-"
"options>` - 취향에 맞게 OKR.BEST 표시 방식을 사용자 지정하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:41
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage your sidebar options </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-sidebar-options>` - Customize your Mattermost channel sidebar to "
"suit your preferences."
msgstr ""
":doc:`사이드바 옵션 관리 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-sidebar-"
"options>` - 취향에 맞게 OKR.BEST 채널 사이드바를 사용자 지정하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:42
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage advanced options </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"advanced-options>` - Customize advanced Mattermost user options to suit "
"your preferences."
msgstr ""
":doc:`고급 옵션 관리 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-advanced-options>` "
"- 취향에 맞게 OKR.BEST 고급 사용자 옵션을 사용자 지정하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:43
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage your plugin preferences </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-plugin-preferences>` - Customize Mattermost plugin preferences for "
"Microsoft Teams and Calls."
msgstr ""
":doc:`플러그인 환경설정 관리 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-plugin-"
"preferences>` - Microsoft Teams 및 통화용 OKR.BEST 플러그인 환경설정을 사용자 "
"지정하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:44
msgid ""
":doc:`Customize your desktop app experience </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/customize-desktop-app-experience>` - Learn about additional preferences "
"available only in the desktop app."
msgstr ""
":doc:`데스크톱 앱 환경 사용자 지정 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-"
"desktop-app-experience>` - 데스크톱 앱에서만 제공되는 추가 환경설정을 "
"알아보세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences.rst:45
msgid ""
":doc:`Connect to multiple Mattermost workspaces </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/connect-multiple-workspaces>` - Learn how to connect to"
" multiple Mattermost workspaces using the Mattermost desktop or mobile "
"app."
msgstr ""
":doc:`여러 OKR.BEST 워크스페이스에 연결 </end-user-guide/preferences/connect-"
"multiple-workspaces>` - OKR.BEST 데스크톱 또는 모바일 앱으로 여러 OKR.BEST "
"워크스페이스에 연결하는 방법을 알아보세요."

